              "content": "Which of the following mean that something is not important?",
              "options": [
                "a. Superstition",
                "b. Dismiss",
                "c. Vibrate",
                "d. Miserable"
              ],
              "explanation": "Dismiss: To say it is not important.",
              "correctAnswer": "B"
            },
            {
              "id": "2",
              "content": "What is the power that causes things to happen?",
              "options": [
                "a. Affection",
                "b. To originate",
                "c. To wander",
                "d. Fate"
              ],
              "explanation": "Fate: A power that causes some things to happen.",
              "correctAnswer": "D"
            },
            {
              "id": "3",
              "content": "What is the hot liquid from a volcano called?",
              "options": [
                "a. Shallow",
                "b. Ash",
                "c. Slope",
                "d. Lava"
